"Udyogini Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"us","briefDescription":"Udyogini is an innovative scheme to assist women in gaining self-reliance and economic independence through self-employment, mainly through trade and the service sector. It also provides for a subsidy on loans for undertaking business activities/ micro enterprises through banks, etc.","tags":["Entrepreneurship","Loan","Social Welfare","Citizen Empowerment","Women","Subsidy"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"yKH9F5gBXu-iUKXqZnjq","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Karnataka"],"schemeShortTitle":"SSS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Shrama Shakthi Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"sss","briefDescription":"Under the Shrama Shakthi Loan scheme, religious minority community entrepreneurs will be trained in artistic and technical skills and will be provided a loan of ₹50,000/- with a 4% rate of interest, to be paid in 36 installments.","tags":["Artisans","Loan","Minority","Karnataka","Government Scheme For Minorities"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"WcbgF5gB0AGc0F0i6zcE","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Sikkim"],"schemeShortTitle":"SYSS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship","Agriculture,Rural & Environment","Skills & Employment"],"schemeName":"Skilled Youth Startup Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"syss","briefDescription":"Sikkim Skilled Youth Startup Scheme was launched in 2020 and is implemented by the Department of Commerce & Industries which aims at assisting the educated unemployed youth in setting up a myriad of enterprises through loans with back-ended financial subsidy assistance. ","tags":["Business","StartUp","Employment","Entrepreneurship","Youth"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"ZRezF5gB5uF80_MGi49M","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Maharashtra"],"schemeShortTitle":"LGSS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship","Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Social welfare & Empowerment"],"schemeName":"LIDCOM Gattai Stall Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"lgss","briefDescription":"Being implemented by LIDCOM, Govt. of Maharashtra for the Roadsides Cobblers from the (Scheduled Caste) Charmakar Community, this scheme provides a 100% subsidy for the erection of a Tin Stall of Size 4’ x 5’ x 6.5’ costing ₹16367/- per stall and ₹500/- incidental charges.","tags":["Business","Subsidy","Entrepreneurship","Banking","Scheduled Caste"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"K8a1F5gB0AGc0F0iKjS7","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["West Bengal"],"schemeShortTitle":"GS-WEST BENGAL","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Gatidhara Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"gs-west-bengal","briefDescription":"The scheme “Gatidhara Scheme” was launched by the Transport Department, Government of West Bengal in August 2014 for employment of registered unemployed youth of the State in the transport sector.","tags":["Unemployed","Youth","Subsidy","Commercial Vehicle","Transport Service"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"36G1F5gBXu-iUKXqInRL","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Gujarat"],"schemeShortTitle":"SSE25KRBUST","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Agriculture,Rural & Environment","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Subsidy Scheme On Establishment Of - 25 Kadaknath/R.I.R. Birds Unit To Scheduled Tribes","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"sse25krbust","briefDescription":"The scheme “Subsidy Scheme on Establishment of - 25 Kadaknath/R.I.R. Birds Unit to Scheduled Tribes” was launched by the Dept. of Agriculture, Farmers Welfare & Co-operation, Govt. of Gujarat to provide employment, nutritious diet and to raise the income of Scheduled Tribe People of Gujarat State.","tags":["Poultry Farming","Scheduled Tribe","Subsidy","Kadaknath","Financial Assistance","Rhode Island Red (RIR)"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"cca2F5gB0AGc0F0iIzSQ","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Delhi"],"schemeShortTitle":"RGSRY","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship","Banking,Financial Services and Insurance"],"schemeName":"Rajiv Gandhi Swavlamban Rojgar Yojna","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"rgsry","briefDescription":"“Rajiv Gandhi Swavlamban Rozgar Yojna” has been designed, developed, and promoted by the Delhi Khadi & Village Industries Board, with the help of the Government of NCT of Delhi, to provide employment opportunities.","tags":["Employment","Youths","Artisans","Trained Professionals","Skilled Technocrats","Entrepreneurs"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"u6HTF5gBXu-iUKXqxXe6","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Kerala"],"schemeShortTitle":"FAE-C","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Financial Assistance To Ex-Convicts","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"fae-c","briefDescription":"The scheme “Financial Assistance to Ex-Convicts” was launched by the Department of Social Justice, Government of Kerala. This scheme is implemented by the Department of Social Justice to help those released from jail from poor economic conditions to find their livelihood.","tags":["Ex-Convict","Financial Assistance","Jail","BPL","Self-employment"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"t6HTF5gBXu-iUKXqsXcy","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Kerala"],"schemeShortTitle":"JS-ESDCV","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Social welfare & Empowerment","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Jeevanam Self-Employment Scheme To Dependents Of Crime Victims","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"js-esdcv","briefDescription":"The scheme “Jeevanam Self-Employment Scheme to Dependents of Crime Victims” was launched by the Department of Social Justice, Government of Kerala.","tags":["Dependent","Victim","Self-Employment","Financial Assistance","Breadwinner"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"phfTF5gB5uF80_MGKpI8","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Tamil Nadu"],"schemeShortTitle":"Uyegp","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Unemployed Youth Employment Generation Programme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"uyegp","briefDescription":"The Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises Department, Government of Tamil Nadu introduced the scheme \"Unemployed Youth Employment Generation Programme (UYEGP)\" which aims to mitigate the unemployment problems of socially and economically weaker sections of the society.","tags":["Unemployment","Youth","Loan","Business","Subsidy","MSME"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"3Re1F5gB5uF80_MGnY_m","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Chhattisgarh"],"schemeShortTitle":"AKSMSY","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship","Women and Child"],"schemeName":"Asangathit Karmakaar Silai Machine Sahayata Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"aksmsy","briefDescription":"Asangathit Karmakaar Silai Machine Sahayata Yojana started by the Government of Chhattisgarh in 2012. \n","tags":["Sewing Machine","Empowerment","Business"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"usa4F5gB0AGc0F0iLTR0","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Goa"],"schemeShortTitle":"TFAPPS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship","Education & Learning"],"schemeName":"Technology Fellowship and Patent Promotion Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"tfapps","briefDescription":"The objective of the scheme is to identify technology educators in technical educational institutes in Goa who are keen to further their expertise. The selected educators/fellows would be sent to Centres of Excellence within the country and abroad to undertake summer school and short-term training.","tags":["Technology","Fellowship","Patent","Grant"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"B8a5F5gB0AGc0F0iwzWy","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Gujarat"],"schemeShortTitle":"SSBOSCBPBS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Scheme for Small Business Owners of Scheduled Castes to Buy a Place of Business/Shop","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"ssboscbpbs","briefDescription":"Under the scheme, financial assistance in the form of loans and subsidies is provided by banks to individuals belonging to the Scheduled Castes category. This assistance is aimed at enabling them to purchase business premises or shops in urban areas for business development.","tags":["Scheduled Caste","Business Development","Shop","Business Premise","Loan","Subsidy"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"EqEyGJgBXu-iUKXqhHkj","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Haryana"],"schemeShortTitle":"SDYP","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Subsidy for Disabled Young Professionals","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"sdyp","briefDescription":"Under this scheme, loans up to ₹25,00,000/- are provided to professionally educated unemployed disabled youth who fall under the OH, VH, HH, or MR categories, at different interest rates ranging from 4.5% to 8% per annum. ","tags":["Subsidy","Young Professional","PwD","Loan","Unemployed","Youth"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"f8a8F5gB0AGc0F0iTzWS","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Haryana"],"schemeShortTitle":"SBSTSPD(DSY)","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Small Business in Service/Trading Sector for Persons with Disabilities (Divyangjan Swavalamban Yojana)","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"sbstspddsy","briefDescription":"The scheme offers loans up to ₹50 lakhs for self-employment to disabled persons in sectors like Agriculture, Small Business/Artisan & Traditional Occupations, Transport & Service Sectors, etc. Eligible individuals can access loans with interest rates ranging from 5% to 9% per annum.","tags":["Small Business","Trading Sector","Service Sector","PwD","Loan","Disability","Divyang","Swavalamban"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"aBe8F5gB5uF80_MGVpFw","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Haryana"],"schemeShortTitle":"LVSH","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Laghu Vyavassay Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"lvsh","briefDescription":"\"Laghu Vyavassay Scheme\" is an economic empowerment scheme by the Haryana Scheduled Castes Finance and Development Corporation, Govt of Haryana. In this scheme, loans are provided to individuals from Scheduled Castes for self-employment/ income-generating activities.","tags":["Loan","Scheduled Caste","Entrepreneurship","Subsidy","Employment"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"K8bZF5gB0AGc0F0i0TfE","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Haryana"],"schemeShortTitle":"AAPD","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Agriculture,Rural & Environment","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Agricultural Activities for Persons with Disabilities","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"aapd","briefDescription":"This scheme provides loans up to ₹10,00,000/- to the persons with disabilities for agricultural production, irrigation, horticulture, sericulture, the purchase of agricultural machinery and equipment for agricultural services, and the marketing of agricultural products etc.","tags":["Agricultural Activities","PwD","Loan","Disabled Person"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"7hcyGJgB5uF80_MGg5MV","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu"],"schemeShortTitle":"IPSFTSMPPU","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Investment Promotion Scheme (IPS) for Thrust Sectors: Scheme For Marine Products Processing Units","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"ipsftsmppu","briefDescription":"“Scheme For Marine Products Processing Units'' under the “Investment Promotion Scheme (IPS)” for Thrust Sectors, implemented by the Dept. of Industries, U.T. Administration of DNH & DD, aims to provide Interest Subsidy to the Establishment /Expansion of Marine products processing industries.","tags":["Thrust Sectors","Food Processing Industries","Incentives","Entrepreneurship","Subsidy","Reimbursement","IPS","Marine Products"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"D8YyGJgB0AGc0F0igzgi","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Dadra & Nagar Haveli and Daman & Diu"],"schemeShortTitle":"IPS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Investment Promotion Scheme (IPS): Environment Protection Infrastructure Subsidy","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"ips","briefDescription":"“Environment Protection Infrastructure Subsidy'' under the “Investment Promotion Scheme (IPS)”, implemented by the Dept. of Industries, U.T. Administration Of DNH & DD, aims to promote Installation of Environment Protection Infrastructure for a cleaner environment.","tags":["Environment","MSMEs","Incentives","Entrepreneurship","Subsidy","Reimbursement","IPS","Infrastructure"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"HBfZF5gB5uF80_MGX5NP","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Delhi"],"schemeShortTitle":"SCBDAEP","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Scheme for Celebration of Birth/death Anniversary of Eminent Personalities","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"scbdaep","briefDescription":"The \"Scheme for Celebration of Birth/Death Anniversary of Eminent Personalities\" scheme aims to provide financial assistance for the celebration of anniversaries/Jayanti's of Sant Kabir, Sant Gadge, and Sant Durbalnath and in addition to Anniversaries of DR. B.R. Ambedkar, etc.","tags":["Financial Assistance","NGO","Anniversary","Jayantis"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"jaG9F5gBXu-iUKXqZnas","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Karnataka"],"schemeShortTitle":"CS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship","Women and Child"],"schemeName":"Charmashilpa Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"cs","briefDescription":"The \"Charmashilpa Scheme\" aims to modernize the leather artisans' production methods by offering financial assistance to setup mechanized production units. This support helps leather artisan SHGs and cooperative societies enhance the quality of their products, making them more competitive.","tags":["Subsidy","SHGs","Co-operative Society","Financial Assistance","Artisans"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"wxe-F5gB5uF80_MGYpEs","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Madhya Pradesh"],"schemeShortTitle":"SPSHS","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Banking,Financial Services and Insurance","Business & Entrepreneurship","Women and Child"],"schemeName":"Savitribai Phule Self-Help Scheme","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"spshs","briefDescription":"The scheme provides financial support to unemployed women from the Scheduled Caste (SC) category in the state to help them start businesses in industry, service, or trade sectors.","tags":["Business Loan","Self Employment","Women Entrepreneurship","Scheduled Caste","Below Poverty Level","SC","BPL"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"MBfbF5gB5uF80_MG3ZN1","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Bihar"],"schemeShortTitle":"MAUYB","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Mukhyamantri Alpasankhyak Udyami Yojana","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"mauyb","briefDescription":"This is a flagship scheme of the Bihar government aimed at promoting entrepreneurship and self-employment among the youth by providing financial assistance of up to ₹10,00,000/- for setting up businesses.\n\n","tags":["Entrepreneurship","Youth","Business","Self Employment","Minority"]},"highlight":{}},{"id":"O6HbF5gBXu-iUKXq3XiR","fields":{"beneficiaryState":["Bihar"],"schemeShortTitle":"SJY","level":"State","schemeFor":"Individual","schemeCategory":["Education & Learning","Business & Entrepreneurship"],"schemeName":"Satat Jeevikoparjan Yojana (SJY)","schemeCloseDate":null,"priority":1,"slug":"sjy","briefDescription":"\"Satat Jeevikoparjan Yojana (SJY)\" is a flagship program launched by the Government of Bihar to uplift ultra-poor households through comprehensive livelihood support, skill-building, and financial inclusion.\n\n","tags":["Livelihood Support","Capacity Building","Rural Development","Skill Upgradation","Training"]},"highlight":{}}],"page":{"total":772,"totalPages":31,"pageNumber":0,"from":0,"size":25}},"sortedBy":"multiple_sort"}}